# sig-brute contributors

## Maintainers

- **tibetty** — project owner and primary author

## Co-authorship

Parts of this codebase, documentation, and test suite were written with assistance
from AI coding agents (Claude and Cursor). Human review, design decisions, and
final acceptance remain with the maintainers listed above.

## Third-party data

- **Type frequency rankings** — derived from the [sigbank](https://github.com/tintinweb/sigbank)
  public signature corpus (see `src/main/resources/type_frequency.txt`).

## How to be listed here

Send a pull request that adds your name under Maintainers after your first merged
contribution, or ask the maintainers to add you.
